      "writtenOn": "2023-09-21T14:03:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think `choooseRenderer` can handle this logic, due to timeline of when we need the atlas vs. just the Renderer but if we take Arman\u0027s suggestion to query specific types of atlases up front in `drawGeometry` we would have more information about what\u0027s being rendered.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 135,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 135,
        "endChar": 95
      },
      "revId": "bd224ed4abf2d8eca4238994271c4425a88cb05e",
